+  /** `ACOS_CONTROL_PG_URL` is unset, so there is no control store to compose against. */
+  'CONTROL_DATABASE_NOT_CONFIGURED',
+  /** `50 §3f` occasion 1 produced no ACTIVE verified bundle in this process. */
